libcreg
------------------------------------------
libcreg is a library to access the Windows 9x/Me Registry File (CREG) format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcreg-devel-20260523-1bl1
  libcreg1-20260523-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libcreg

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libcreg/archive/refs/tags/20260523.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcreg-20260523-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcreg-20260523-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcreg-20260523-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcreg-20260523-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcreg1-20260523-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcreg-devel-20260523-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libcreg-20260523-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libcreg)
  /usr/bin/cregexport.exe
  /usr/bin/creginfo.exe
  /usr/bin/cregmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libcreg.README
  /usr/share/doc/libcreg/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libcreg/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libcreg/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libcreg/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libcreg/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/creginfo.1.gz

(libcreg1)
  /usr/bin/cygcreg-1.dll

(libcreg-devel)
  /usr/include/libcreg.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/error.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/extern.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/features.h
  /usr/include/libcreg/types.h
  /usr/lib/libcreg.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libcreg.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libcreg.3.gz

(python312-libcreg)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pycreg.dll

